But you like you distribute the skill and then it gets that kind of CLI from that as

00:56:00.199 --> 00:56:03.398
opposed to distributing the CLI and that gives the agent the skill.

00:56:04.038 --> 00:56:07.959
Yeah, we've definitely found, I mean, part of it inside the Marimo UI, if you're on any

