run in your terminal that like sets it says use the Marimo pair skill and like, you know

00:56:23.059 --> 00:56:26.839
Toast a notification and like here's where the notebook is running kind of thing

00:56:27.379 --> 00:56:31.219
And that that is kind of the nicest experience I found to being able to launch it

00:56:31.219 --> 00:56:36.338
It's just like you spin up Marimo then you click that and you can sort of be confident. You're connected and keep going

00:56:29.513 --> 00:56:33.513
And that is kind of the nicest experience I found to being able to launch it, is just

00:56:33.513 --> 00:56:37.733
like, you spin up Marimo, then you click that, and you can sort of be confident you're connected

00:56:37.733 --> 00:56:38.733
