was, like, really annoying, or the agent stumbled a bunch, like, that skill basically looked

00:59:39.272 --> 00:59:43.033
at the logs and tried to, like, diagnose, like, some stuff that was, like, kind of annoying

00:59:43.033 --> 00:59:46.833
or, like, things that were hallucinated, and then we would have this, like, internal slack

00:59:46.833 --> 00:59:49.593
where we just share around, like, hey, this happened, hey, this happened, and then that

00:59:49.593 --> 00:59:54.313
was a nice starting point to refining the API for our team prior to us having, like,

00:59:54.313 --> 00:59:57.912
better evals of, like, how code mode is being used.

