And I think also, like, Marimo itself is a very, like, code-first, like, user interface

01:09:08.473 --> 01:09:10.793
for, like, working with data.

01:09:10.793 --> 01:09:15.552
But, you know, in a happy future place, I would love it if somebody is popping open,

01:09:15.552 --> 01:09:20.132
like, Claude desktop or Claude, you know, Codex desktop, and, like, they're asking questions

