with data and behind the scenes, it's, like, using something like Marimo to, like, build

01:09:25.153 --> 01:09:31.072
up some sort of, like, understanding with that data, such that, again, like, that user

01:09:31.072 --> 01:09:34.953
is a much different user from someone like me that, like, knows how to write some code.

01:09:34.953 --> 01:09:38.793
But, like, we're all sort of collaborating on a very similar, like, artifact, because

01:09:38.793 --> 01:09:45.432
I do know folks, like, have friends that are less technical users, but have gotten interested

01:09:45.432 --> 01:09:49.273
or feel very empowered in using, like, coding agents and coding tools.

